# Source decks, PDFs and anything else dropped in to pull figures from. Jekyll
# ignores any top-level directory beginning with an underscore, so nothing in
# here is ever published — and unlike the old `*.pdf` rule it cannot swallow a
# file we actually want on the site, such as the CV.
